---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const b = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const videos = [
  { id: 'J6H34AYSn4Y', label: 'Performance 01' },
  { id: 'aNsxS4OxUXg', label: 'Performance 02' },
];
---
<Layout title="About me" active="about">
  <section class="about-page" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="page-heading"><h1 id="about-title">About me</h1></div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <figure class="portrait">
        <img src={`${b}jamily-portrait.webp`} alt="Jamily Lee holding a violin outdoors" width="1365" height="2048" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>I was born in Taiwan and began playing the violin at the age of seven. I am currently pursuing a dual degree in Violin Performance and Music Education at UCLA, where I study with Varty Manouelian.</p>
        <p>As an alumna of the San Francisco Symphony Youth Orchestra (2021–2024), I have continued to develop my passion for orchestral music through various summer festivals. I attended the Chautauqua Institution School of Music in 2025 and 2026, where I performed alongside members of the Chautauqua Symphony Orchestra and Buffalo Philharmonic Orchestra in a Mahler symphony performance. In 2023, I attended the Round Top Festival Institute, where I served as concertmaster for the children’s concert. I also participated in the Taipei Music Academy &amp; Festival (2022) and the Sounding Point Academy at the Colburn School (2022).</p>
        <p>As a chamber musician, I have performed with distinguished musicians including Cho-Liang Lin, Ilya Kaler, Frank Huang, and Cynthia Phelps. I have also participated in masterclasses and private lessons with renowned violinists and educators including Regis Pasquier, Almita Vamos, and Midori. Outside of classical music, I have performed with Jacob Collier at Davies Symphony Hall and with Zade Dirani at UCLA’s Royce Hall.</p>
        <p>I am also passionate about music education. I served as a Teaching Fellow at Elemental Music from 2025–2026 and have been teaching private violin and piano lessons and coaching string sectionals since 2020. Through my teaching, I enjoy helping young musicians develop both their technical skills and their appreciation for music.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="performances-section" aria-labelledby="performances-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="performances-title">Performances</h2></div>
    <div class="videos-grid">
      {videos.map(video => <article class="video-card">
        <div class="video-frame"><iframe src={`https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/${video.id}`} title={`Jamily Lee — ${video.label}`} loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>
        <a href={`https://youtu.be/${video.id}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="video-label">Watch on YouTube <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>)}
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
